WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
I have entered the church

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,720
It's full of stoves

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,520
There are many spices on the stove

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,960
Something like a hook

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,240
There are some boxes on the ground

6
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,840
Everything hanging on the hooks is meat

7
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,880
There are people among them

8
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,760
How on earth did she wear a hound dress?

9
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,160
Haven't been shot by eyes yet

10
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,160
Entering the church

11
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,660
Could it be that she is also one of the uniquely talented people?

12
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,860
It seems that this Sikong Lan still has something to offer.

13
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,420
Within the range covered by total radiation

14
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,660
There are at least three survivor cabins nearby

15
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,900
Maybe you need to contact them to work together

16
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,700
There are actually two groups of survivors around me

17
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:34,080
I didn't notice it at all

18
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,800
The outline inside that meat ball

19
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,880
According to my observation

20
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,390
is a werewolf

21
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:40,830
And it is definitely not a slave-level creature

22
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:43,870
Perhaps the ultimate goal is to kill it
